  "body": "In https://github.com/heycam/webidl/commit/079cbb861a99e9e857a3f2a169c0beeb49cd020a the T[] Web IDL type was removed.\n\nAfter #10, the remaining uses in the spec of T[] will be:\n- [x] MessageEvent#ports (see also https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=23176)\n- [x] HTMLPropertiesCollection#names (entire class was dropped)\n- [x] DataTransfer#types\n- [x] Location#ancestorOrigins (see also https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=22699)\n- [x] NavigatorLanguage#languages\n\nI haven't looked yet whether these can be completely replaced with FrozenArray<T> or whether something trickier might be needed.\n",
